title: Tags
permalink: /tags/
---
<p class="prompt"><span class="ps1">grep -c</span> <span class="cmd">tags posts/* | sort -rn | head</span></p>
<h1>Tags</h1>
<p>Categories are the <em>kind</em> of post (<a href="{{ '/categories/' | url }}">see them</a>); tags are the things inside it: bands, games, gear. The common ones are here, and everything else is below.</p>
<ul class="tag-cloud">
  {% for t in collections.tagList %}{% if t.count >= 3 %}
  <li><a href="{{ ("/tags/" + t.slug + "/") | url }}">{{ t.name }}</a> <span class="count">{{ t.count }}</span></li>
  {% endif %}{% endfor %}
</ul>
<details>
  <summary>everything else (the tags used once or twice)</summary>
  <ul class="tag-cloud">
    {% for t in collections.tagList %}{% if t.count < 3 %}
    <li><a href="{{ ("/tags/" + t.slug + "/") | url }}">{{ t.name }}</a> <span class="count">{{ t.count }}</span></li>
    {% endif %}{% endfor %}
  </ul>
</details>
